<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>稳定 → 效率 → 排斥私情</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>接龙</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34' }}>稳定</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D', marginHorizontal: 16 }}>↓ 因为要</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34' }}>效率</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D', marginHorizontal: 16 }}>↓ 所以</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34' }}>排斥私情</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 30, borderLeft: '4px solid #B4552D', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>事业单位要讲效率，效率要求纪律，</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>纪律容不下私情——这是结构决定的，不是道德要求。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 22 }}>追问：这和“男女不平等”是一回事吗？</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 3 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>15/18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>